#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2308 expect=skipped domain=PC
#note "FLIPPED violation -> skipped by the R-5.25 split (top-level-or board wave 2, group J, plan §4). PCELTM is not present in the dataset; the pre-split bare empty() leaf was TRUE on every row (absent = all-missing, EC-43) and flooded. The parent now owns only the PCELTM half under Requirements.Variables.All [PCELTM]: an auditable SKIP naming the column. The day-anchor half lives in the split sibling FDA-SE2308-A, which EXECUTES here (VISITDY/PCNOMDY populated -> silent). If this EXECUTES, the gate has been removed - escalate, do not rewrite."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1
dataset PC class=FINDINGS label="Pharmacokinetics Concentrations"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col PCSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col VISITDY type=Num  label="Planned Study Day of Visit"
col PCNOMDY type=Num  label="Nominal Study Day for Tabulations"
---
S1 | PC | 001 | 1 | 3 | 1
